{
    "title": "Tancha S32 Classic Watch Face",
    "description": "<b><font color=\"#e90707\">Tancha S32 Classic Watch Face</font></b>\r\nElegant watch face; Roman numerals, customizable colors, red accents. Date display.\r\n\r\nThis watch face is developed by Tancha Watch Faces for use on Wear OS devices.\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#e90707\">FEATURES</font></b>\r\n<b><font color=\"#e90707\">Analog Watch Face: A traditional analog watch face for timeless elegance.</font></b>\r\n<font color=\"#e90707\">*</font> 11 Custom Background Colors: Personalize your watch with a choice of 10 custom background colors. (tap to change color.)\r\n<font color=\"#e90707\">*</font> Days of the Month: Easily keep track of each day of the month.\r\n<font color=\"#e90707\">*</font> Always On View: Keep your watch display on at all times, ensuring your information is readily visible.\r\n\r\nFAQ :\r\n1- The watch face is installed on your watch but does not appear in the catalog?\r\n\r\nFOLLOW THESE STEPS:\r\n\r\nPress and hold your watch screen.\r\nSwipe right until you see the text 'Add watch face.'\r\nPress the '+ Add watch face' button.\r\nFind and activate the watch face you installed.\r\n\r\n\r\n2- If the companion app is installed but the watch face is not, follow the steps below:\r\n\r\nFOLLOW THESE STEPS:\r\n\r\nOpen the companion app on your phone (ensure that your smartwatch is connected to your phone).\r\nNext, tap the 'INSTALL WATCH FACE ON WATCH' button at the bottom of the app.\r\nThis will open the Play Store on your WEAR OS smartwatch, displaying the purchased watch face and allowing you to install it directly.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or requests, please don't hesitate to get in touch with me at tanchawatch@gmail.com. \r\n\r\n\r\nThank you sincerely for your support.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nTancha Watch Faces",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b><font color=\"#e90707\">Tancha S32 Classic Watch Face</font></b><br>Elegant watch face; Roman numerals, customizable colors, red accents. Date display.<br><br>This watch face is developed by Tancha Watch Faces for use on Wear OS devices.<br><br><b><font color=\"#e90707\">FEATURES</font></b><br><b><font color=\"#e90707\">Analog Watch Face: A traditional analog watch face for timeless elegance.</font></b><br><font color=\"#e90707\">*</font> 11 Custom Background Colors: Personalize your watch with a choice of 10 custom background colors. (tap to change color.)<br><font color=\"#e90707\">*</font> Days of the Month: Easily keep track of each day of the month.<br><font color=\"#e90707\">*</font> Always On View: Keep your watch display on at all times, ensuring your information is readily visible.<br><br>FAQ :<br>1- The watch face is installed on your watch but does not appear in the catalog?<br><br>FOLLOW THESE STEPS:<br><br>Press and hold your watch screen.<br>Swipe right until you see the text &#39;Add watch face.&#39;<br>Press the &#39;+ Add watch face&#39; button.<br>Find and activate the watch face you installed.<br><br><br>2- If the companion app is installed but the watch face is not, follow the steps below:<br><br>FOLLOW THESE STEPS:<br><br>Open the companion app on your phone (ensure that your smartwatch is connected to your phone).<br>Next, tap the &#39;INSTALL WATCH FACE ON WATCH&#39; button at the bottom of the app.<br>This will open the Play Store on your WEAR OS smartwatch, displaying the purchased watch face and allowing you to install it directly.<br><br><br>If you have any questions or requests, please don&#39;t hesitate to get in touch with me at tanchawatch@gmail.com. <br><br><br>Thank you sincerely for your support.<br><br>Best regards,<br>Tancha Watch Faces",
